    <div id="console" hidden><aside><div class="brand">ADHD</div><p class="subtitle">Agentic Distributed Harness Depot</p><nav aria-label="Workspace"><button data-view="Overview" aria-current="page">Overview</button><button data-view="Information">Information</button><button data-view="Subscriptions">Subscriptions</button><button data-view="Activity">Activity</button></nav><button id="help-toggle">Operations guide</button><button id="logout">Log out</button></aside><section class="workspace"><header><div><p id="project" class="eyebrow"></p><h1 id="view-title">Overview</h1></div><button id="refresh">Refresh</button></header><p id="state" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="error" role="alert"></p><div id="content"></div><section id="guide" hidden><h2>Operations guide</h2><p>One process owns each DETS store. Provision distinct agent bearer tokens of at least 24 characters and an optional administrator token of 32–65536 bytes in the operator configuration. Keep that file private. Rotate credentials by updating configuration and restarting the service. Use the configured private tunnel URL; the listener binds only to 127.0.0.1.</p><p>Published information is project-wide and retained after acknowledgement. Addressed messages are private to recipients: administrators see delivery metadata only. Subscriptions apply to future publications. Removing one cancels pending work and retains older deliveries. Retrying jobs resets pending work only. Matching failures leave information usable and jobs durable.</p><p>Refresh to observe actual matcher health. Check the matcher service and private tunnel on outages. Back up the DETS file offline with the service stopped. Preserve an offline pre-upgrade backup before opening legacy schema 1; schema 2 retains original source-event deduplication. An old-runtime rollback must restore that backup. Do not run two services against one store. Binary attachments, external connectors, multi-project operation and automatic refresh are outside this version.</p></section></section></div></main></body></html>
